  "notes": "The State sets programmes and the vice-rectorat runs secondary schooling: six collèges (6e–3e), the Lycée d'État (general and technological) and an agricultural lycée. Primary (10 écoles) was conceded in 1969 to the Catholic mission's Direction de l'enseignement catholique; a 2025 law moved its teachers to the State. The school year starts in February, and many children born in the second half of the year start a year late. Maternelle is left out, so CP (age 6) is year 1. The brevet closes 3e and the baccalauréat Terminale."
